    "expertise": [
      "Real-world search-demand validation vs internal service naming",
      "Search intent and funnel-stage classification",
      "SERP competitor gap analysis across multiple English-speaking markets at once",
      "AEO — structuring content for AI answer engines (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews)",
